  "readme": "# Four existing ADV_still_009 CG references in episode11 IF-Otto\n\nSet only character_image at10110002/41–44 toADV_still_009. Four original source witnesses at225/228.5/231/233.5s, the original1536×2048 PNG and the existing published WebP were directly compared by the independent delegated image reviewer. They show the same Felt/Subaru/Rom foreground and Emilia/Pack background composition with green shards. Root did not view images. These fields identify the static resource only.\n\nThe existing WebP and full-catalog/package registration already satisfy the normal resource contract. The apparent full/preview-catalog path difference follows the current read-only resource projection; no new registration, decoding, transcoding or asset mutation was required. Default compressed delivery is supported by the existing mapping. The uncompressed PNG exists in the local original extraction but its physical D/assets/pictures path is absent: explicit original-quality delivery is not accepted by this package.\n\nRoot explicitly rebound the two historical ffad whole-file peer guards after the separate e80535-character publication, verifying that all four complete selected native/review rows remain identical. Current full44row staging and saved checks differ only at these four image leaves; all36 existing character bindings and every text/voice/command/branch/order field remain exact. All22 protected files and all other scenes remain unchanged.\n\nNormal original stage/audit/apply and full manifest/ownership/one-batch checks passed. There is no new background, multi-actor20 reconstruction, blueFX, action, expression, animation, phase, geometry, timing, listening or saved-gameplay acceptance. In particular this still comparison does not establish continuous CG persistence.\n\nAll non-image evidence is losslessly gzip stored so original whitespace remains exact. Index records both original and stored byte lengths/SHA256. Source witnesses remain original bytes.\n"
